 "text": "Hi, how have you been? They are tough predators, and they learn quickly. A single bug spray won't do much. What you need is a trap. Sure thing. The basic design is a small container half full of water, with a little dish of sweet wine on a stick sticking into the water. Then act like Gary and keep your voice calm. It doesn't matter. Just text it to yourself and try again. Bye. Okay. Mosquito trap. half full of water. A plate of sweet wine on a stick in the middle. They' drawn by the smell and drown easily. Then stick to the traps. They're much safer. You can use a bit of wood glue to stick the stick down well and prevent the wine from getting dark.",
